; D8-defaults: an expression-shaped default whose declared result does
; not match the key type. `lbl` declares `:result string`; `:fps` is a
; number-typed key. validateDefaults verdict: `.no` → wrong_underlying
; at the schema-aggregate phase, path [plugin, form, key, default].
(plugin :name default-test :version "1.0.0"
  (expr-func :name lbl :arity (fixed 0) :result string)
  (form :name scene
    (key :name fps :type number :default (lbl))))
